# Episode 10: Emergency Contact

INT. AAROGYA RECEPTION - MORNING

The blue cast lies on the counter, cut open. Meera rubs her pale, thin wrist.

JYOTHI slides a form across.

JYOTHI
Emergency contact update చేయాలా, madam?

Meera picks up the pen.

A long silence.

The entrance doors hiss open. KARTHIK, unshaven, with a backpack, straight off the Warangal bus, stops a few feet away, breathing hard.

KARTHIK
అమ్మ చెప్పింది... ఇవాళ నీ cast తీసేస్తారని.

A flicker on Meera's face. She and Sarala have been texting.

KARTHIK (CONT'D)
Meera.

Before she can answer, his phone rings: "Amma calling".

He looks at it. Looks at her. Then he presses speaker.

KARTHIK (CONT'D)
(into phone, loud enough for the whole queue)
అమ్మా. Meera తో ఉన్నా.
(beat)
Work లో కాదు. నా మనిషి.

The queue goes quiet. Jyothi stops typing.

SARALA (V.O.)
(on speaker)
తెలుసురా. ఇప్పటికి చెప్పావ్.

She hangs up.

Karthik lowers the phone and turns to Meera, unsteady.

KARTHIK
పేరు పెడితే పోతుంది అనుకున్నా. పెట్టకపోతే నువ్వే పోయావ్.

Meera doesn't run to him. She holds his gaze.

MEERA
నేను కూడా ఎప్పుడూ అడగలేదు. ఎవరినీ. అడగడానికి భయం.
(beat)
ఇప్పుడు అడుగుతున్నా.

She slides the form and pen to him.

MEERA (CONT'D)
అయితే నువ్వే రాయి. Relationship column కూడా.

He takes the pen and writes. He doesn't hesitate this time.

Then he reaches into her tote bag, takes out the cut cast, and signs the inside of it.

Her phone buzzes: "Arjun".

ON SCREEN: "Pune transfer accepted, next month nunchi. Take care, Meeru. Ee saari, evarini pilavalanukunte vaallani pilu."

Meera reads it twice. A small, sad smile. She types "Thank you, Arjun." and sends it.

JYOTHI
(dry, collecting the form)
So... boyfriend?

Meera looks at Karthik. Karthik looks at the floor, then at her.

MEERA
(smiling)
ఇంకా decide చేయలేదు.

Jyothi holds the form. In his handwriting, out of focus, the line reads "Relationship: ____".

> FADE OUT.
